        "created_at": "2018-05-26T01:30:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"morph147\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> morph147:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I will add that if GTG wanted to make some money, an insert system for this game that can hold everything to date can be huge.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>it's definitely an option in Broken Token's poll, and there's a guy who does a foamcore insert that holds everything but uses both boxes, and I've seen at least one set of plans on BGG for a laser cutter. the interest is definitely there.</p>",
